      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process immediately before that process starts**. \n\nMore specifically, the page states that:\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is then injected only into the **environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process** (or Query agent child process)\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is **never** mutated and never holds the key\n\nThis approach ensures that a compromised Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting environment variables \u2014 the key exists only in the short-lived child process that actually needs it to call the Anthropic API.",
